    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαιαί</span></b> , αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stones</i>, used as weights to
			keep the threads of the warp straight in the upright loom (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνύς</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				717a35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				787b26
			</span></i>; or to move automata, in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>, al.: nom. sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					558.57
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
				</span></i>
			 l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Spir.</u>
				2.27
			</span></i>: nom. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.564
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.36
			</span></i>: acc. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαιάς</span> Arist.ll.cc.</div>
